  "title": "Bit Digital, Inc. Announces Date for Fiscal Year 2024 Financial Results and Conference Call",
  "summary": "Bit Digital, Inc. (NASDAQ: BTBT) announced today that it will release its Fiscal Year 2024 results on Friday, March 14, 2025, before the stock market opens. Senior management will host a live webcast and conference call to review that day at 10:00 a.m. ET.",
